 "finalMessage": "Fixed the eager-preload `TypeError: Invalid URL` for anchors claimed before adoption. In `src/data/events.ts` `anchorUrl`, the code read the resolved DOM `a.href` property and called `new URL(href)` with no base, so a still-detached anchor (template clone, not yet adopted) returned the raw `/a`, and `new URL(\"/a\")` threw. I changed it to read the raw attribute (`getAttribute(\"href\")`, or SVG `base"
}